---
description: Manifest V3 manifest.json rules
globs: "**/manifest.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

- `"manifest_version": 3`. Background is `{ "service_worker": "background.js", "type": "module" }` — never `scripts` or `page`.
- Use `"action"` for the toolbar button, not `browser_action`/`page_action`.
- Adding any entry to `permissions` or `host_permissions` requires a justification line in `PERMISSIONS.md`. Prefer `activeTab`.
- Prefer `optional_host_permissions` for sites the user opts into.
- No remote URLs in `content_security_policy`. Do not loosen the default extension CSP.
- `web_accessible_resources` lists only files a page genuinely needs, with narrow `matches`.
- Bump `version` (dot-separated integers, e.g. `1.2.0`) on every store upload.
- Keep `description` under 132 characters; it is shown in the store.
